ly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack\" style=\"max-width:420px; width:100%;\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h1>Sign in</h1>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Welcome back. Enter your credentials to access your account.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <form class=\"stack gap-lg\" id=\"login-form\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <label class=\"label\" style=\"display:block;\">\n            <span class=\"small\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Email</span>\n            <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" required autocomplete=\"email\">\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"between\">\n            <span class=\"small\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Password</span>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" onclick=\"togglePassword()\" id=\"toggle-btn\">Show</button>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"label\" style=\"display:block;\">\n            <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" required autocomplete=\"current-password\">\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"between\">\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"remember\">\n            Remember me for 30 days\n          </label>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"alert alert-destructive\" id=\"error\" style=\"display:none;\">\n          Invalid email or password. Please try again.\n        </div>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-block btn-lg\" id=\"submit-btn\">Sign in</button>\n\n        <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"text-align:center;\">Forgot your password? Contact your administrator to reset it.</p>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  function togglePassword() {\n    var pw = document.getElementById('password');\n    var btn = document.getElementById('toggle-btn');\n    if (pw.type === 'password') { pw.type = 'text'; btn.textContent = 'Hide'; }\n    else { pw.type = 'password'; btn.textContent = 'Show'; }\n  }\n\n  document.getElementById('login-form').addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    var btn = document.getElementById('submit-btn');\n    var err = document.getElementById('error');\n    btn.disabled = true;\n    btn.textContent = 'Signing in…';\n    setTimeout(function () {\n      var email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();\n      var pw = document.getElementById('password').value;\n      if (email && pw.length >= 8) {\n        err.style.display = 'none';\n        btn.textContent = 'Signed in ✓';\n      } else {\n        err.style.display = 'block';\n        btn.disabled = false;\n        btn.textContent = 'Sign in';\n      }\n    }, 700);\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[3333,"<div"],[3333," class"],[3333,"=\""],[3333,"page"],[3333,"\">\n"],[3333," "],[3333," <"],[3333,"div"],[3333," class"],[3333,"=\""],[3333,"stack"],[3333,"\""],[3333," style"],[3333,"=\""],[3333,"max"],[3333,"-width"],[3333,":"],[3333,"420"],[3333,"px"],[3333,";"],[3333," width"],[3333,":"],[3333,"100"],[3333,"%;\">\n"],[3333,"   "],[3333," <"],[3333,"div"],[3333," class"],[3333,"=\""],[3333